Macro: account_appissue_tips. Title: Account::AppIssue::Tips. Body: Hello Vojtech,

Thank you for reaching out. Before digging deeper into the issue, we'd like to ask you to do a few simple steps first.

• Make sure that the scooter you're trying to connect to is displayed on the map in the Voi app and has above 20% battery;
• Make sure that you have both Bluetooth and 4G on;
• Make sure that the Voi app and your phone software are updated;
• Restart the app and try performing the action again (you probably won't believe it but in most cases, this helps!).

If the issue persists, please get back to us with a description of the problem and your actions. It'd be amazing if you could send us a screenshot of the error as well as your phone model, iOS/Android version and the Voi app version.

Thank you so much! Looking forward to your reply!.

Macro: discounts_voucher_tips. Title: Discounts::Voucher::Tips. Body: Hi Vojtech,

Thank you for reaching out.

Before we proceed further, check the following points to make sure everything works properly:

• Your Voi app is updated;
• Payment method and a phone number are connected to your Voi account;
• The voucher isn’t expired;
• The formatting of the voucher code is correct (you need to paste the code exactly the way you received it, including lowercase and uppercase letters, numbers, or symbols - no extra spaces).

If still no luck, let me know and I'll sort it out for you!.
